TOUCH(1)                       User Commands                        TOUCH(1)

NAME
    touch - create an empty file

SYNOPSIS
    touch NAME

DESCRIPTION
    Create an empty regular file called NAME in the working directory,
    owned by your login with mode 0644. A name that already exists is
    refused; touch does not change times, because the filesystem keeps
    none.

SEE ALSO
    echo(1), rm(1), chmod(1)
